<timeline-preview wx:if="{{isTimelinePreview}}" id="timeline-preview" context="{{timelineContext}}" />
<block wx:elif="{{timelinePageReady}}">
<view class="ride-page privacy-page">
  <view class="privacy-container">
    <view class="privacy-header">
      <text class="ride-title privacy-title">隐私政策</text>
      <view class="privacy-meta">
        <text class="ride-chip ride-chip--accent privacy-updated">最近更新：{{updatedAt}}</text>
      </view>
      <text class="privacy-intro">
        本政策说明“纽约生活”小程序在共享出行、二手交易、个人资料和服务运营中如何收集、使用、存储和保护你的信息。
      </text>
      <button class="ride-btn ride-primary ride-btn--primary privacy-contract" bindtap="openWechatPrivacyContract" hover-class="ride-pressed" hover-stay-time="80">查看微信隐私保护指引</button>
    </view>

    <view class="privacy-content">
      <view class="ride-card ride-card-pad privacy-section" wx:for="{{sections}}" wx:for-item="section" wx:key="title">
        <view class="privacy-section-head">
          <text class="ride-section-title privacy-section-title">{{section.title}}</text>
        </view>
        <view class="privacy-lines">
          <view class="privacy-line" wx:for="{{section.lines}}" wx:for-item="line" wx:key="*this">
            <view class="privacy-marker"></view>
            <text class="privacy-line-text">{{line}}</text>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
</block>
